{"id":"6f3411be790eb1c9","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md","title":"无类型性不蕴含非保守性","display":"thm-untyped-nonconservative — 无类型性不蕴含非保守性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-untyped-nonconservative","aliases":["91-thm-untyped-nonconservative"],"display":"thm-untyped-nonconservative — 无类型性不蕴含非保守性","depends_on":["[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","[[91-df-untyped-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-untyped-nonconservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-untyped-nonconservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-untyped-nonconservative — 无类型性不蕴含非保守性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52e708105e8ce779\" href=\"?note=52e708105e8ce779\" title=\"91-df-untyped-truth\">91-df-untyped-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (Peano 算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UTB}\">\\(\\mathrm{UTB}\\)</span> (PA 上的统一去引号理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言句子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\\)</span> (同一谓词可形成关于含真理句子的真理原子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(S,\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(S,\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>\n(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 对 PA 的基础语言保守性,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}nonconservative}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}nonconservative}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}nonconservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}nonconservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>文件标签保留原名以维持既有链接，但原来的“UTB 非保守”命题是反例。\nUTB 的 uniform 双条件只让 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 遍历基础语言\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 的公式；它没有给所有含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公式全透明的自应用\nT-schema。标准模型扩张论证表明 UTB 对 PA 的基础语言后果是保守的。</p>\n<p>仅从每个 PA 定理的逐个 UTB 实例，可以得到每个固定定理的去引号，\n却不能把所有 PA 证明统一压缩成对象语言中的全局反射原则。\n要证明这种声性，需要额外的扩展语言归纳或证明归纳；这些附加原则才可能\n带来新的算术后果。故非保守性取决于具体公理和归纳强度，而不由\n“无类型”这一句法性质单独决定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-untyped-truth","status":"resolved","id":"52e708105e8ce779","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-untyped-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UTB}$ (PA 上的统一去引号理论, see [[91-df-UTB]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(S,\\mathrm{PA})$\n($S$ 对 PA 的基础语言保守性,\nsee [[91-df-conservative-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UTB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(S,\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}nonconservative}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}untyped\\text{-}nonconservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Untyped\\text{-}Truth}(T,\\mathcal L_T)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1971,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["2f215d3f10d33ae6","4a1d989a5f615933","52e708105e8ce779"]}